menuconfig MODULES_OFNAV
	bool "ofnav optical-flow navigation monitor"
	default n
	---help---
		PX4/NuttX module that runs the ofnav RTOS core on uORB optical-flow,
		rangefinder, IMU and attitude topics. The module publishes diagnostic
		debug_vect output and is safe-by-default: it does not replace EKF2.
